          "type": null,
          "body": "@lekensteyn The use of the dissector name dates back at least to your 2015 change 93ed72642b3bc0771c6099c4861a39c080040b0e; what was the reason why the dissector name (which, as noted, isn't guaranteed to be a protocol name) was used?",
